 Netflix Trends Analysis Dashboard – Power BI Project

Overview
This Power BI project analyzes Netflix viewing trends, content distribution, and performance insights to uncover patterns in  content type preferences, and regional availability.
It helps understand how Netflix content evolves over time and what factors contribute to its success on the platform.

Objective
To extract meaningful insights from Netflix’s dataset using data visualization, aiming to:
Understand content trends over the years
Analyze genre and rating distributions
Identify top-performing content by country and type
Track release trends across years and platforms



The dataset used includes:
Title, type (Movie/TV Show)
Genre, Country, Release Year
Date added, Rating, Duration


Source: Kaggle Netflix Dataset 

 🛠 Tools & Techniques
 Power BI for interactive dashboard creation
 Excel for data cleaning and preprocessing
 Slicers, filters, and visuals like bar charts, pie charts, and KPIs

Insights Derived
Netflix has steadily increased TV show releases in recent years
US dominates in content production, but global diversity is growing
TV-MA" and TV-14 are among the most common ratings
certain genres like Drama and Comedy dominate the catalog
